WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:02.320
Welcome to Invest Ghana at mHub.

00:02.320 --> 00:04.200
Thanks for joining us.

00:04.200 --> 00:06.120
I'm Dozie with Dozie's Grill.

00:06.120 --> 00:08.520
It's a joy and honor to showcase

00:08.520 --> 00:10.560
cuisine from West Africa,

00:10.560 --> 00:12.640
including the world-famous sobolo.

00:12.640 --> 00:14.640
We're also showcasing some Chi-Town jollof,

00:14.640 --> 00:17.360
peri-peri chicken, plantains.

00:17.360 --> 00:20.440
I hope you're enjoying it
and having a great time.
